The Go port was implemented by Radhi Fadlillah, as credited upstream.

Chromium DOM Distiller: Copyright 2014 The Chromium Authors. BSD-3-Clause
and Apache-2.0 terms are retained in licenses/LICENSE-chromium.txt.
The pinned Go module's LICENSE-domdistiller.txt is empty; that original is
retained separately as licenses/LICENSE-domdistiller-upstream.txt.
The complete notice comes from Chromium revision
2a180397710719913340a12804affc65b789275e, not from an invented replacement.

Boilerpipe: the original copyright, Apache-2.0 license statement, and NOTICE
are retained in licenses/LICENSE-boilerpipe.txt and
licenses/NOTICE-boilerpipe.txt. The complete Apache-2.0 terms appear in
